            </div>
            <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-amiri font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-4">Hakimabad</h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-secondary-light font-amiri font-bold italic mb-3 glow-gold">Khanka-e-Mozaddedia</p>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/60 font-inter max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-8">
              <span class="text-white/80">"A school of mystical thought propounded by <span class="text-secondary-light font-medium">Hazrat Mojaddede Alfe Sani</span> (rh.)"</span>
              <br>- Following the path of truth through <span class="text-secondary-light">knowledge</span>, <span class="text-secondary-light">practice</span>, and <span class="text-secondary-light">sincerity</span>.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
              <a href="audio-playlist.html" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 bg-secondary text-primary-dark font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-secondary-light transition-all shadow-2xl shadow-black/30">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
                🎵 Listen to Mahfil
              </a>
